Subject: [PATCH net 03/14] netfilter: nf_tables: add NFT_TRANS_PREPARE_ERROR to deal with bound set/chain
Date:   Wed, 21 Jun 2023 12:07:20 +0200
Message-Id: <20230621100731.68068-4-pablo@netfilter.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.30.2
In-Reply-To: <20230621100731.68068-1-pablo@netfilter.org>
References: <20230621100731.68068-1-pablo@netfilter.org>
MIME-Version: 1.0
